cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Emblema"
abstract: >-
  A research platform for label-efficient representation learning on heterogeneous sensor
  streams. One permutation-invariant, variable-channel transformer is pretrained without labels
  on corpora that differ in channel count and sampling regime, then adapted to small labelled
  tasks, and compared with tuned classical baselines under paired confidence intervals.
authors:
  - family-names: "Stasiak"
    given-names: "Łukasz"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lstasiak/emblema"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - self-supervised learning
  - foundation model
  - time series
  - irregular sampling
  - label efficiency
  - transfer learning
